            <ArticleTitle>Health maintenance strategies for women of different ages. An overview.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>673-94</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Preventive health strategies for screening for specific illnesses, counseling, and immunization are discussed. Emphasis is given to cardiovascular screening and risk reduction, screening for malignancies, and immunization practices. A framework for designing periodic health examinations for patients is detailed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
